OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThe chance
OL,6,Fof an isolated heavy shower or
OL,7,Fthunderstorm in eastern areas at first
OL,8,Fthis evening, then generally dry
OL,9,Fovernight with clear spells. Light
OL,10,Fdrizzly showers may arrive in Anglesey
OL,11,Fand Gwynedd later. Remaining rather
OL,12,Fwarm and humid for some.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSaturday:FAny isolated showers in the
OL,15,Fwest clearing to leave a dry day with
OL,16,Fsunny periods. Generally feeling
OL,17,Fsomewhat fresher in the northerly
OL,18,Fbreeze but locally very warm in the
OL,19,Fsouth.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
