OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FMostly
OL,6,Fdry on Sunday and Monday with sunny
OL,7,Fspells. Breezier by Tuesday with the
OL,8,Fchance of some welcome rain or showers
OL,9,Ffor some. Still warm with temperatures
OL,10,Fmostly above average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
